  "checks": [
    "Home distinguishes illustrative borrowing and sale amounts from actual local listings",
    "Search, maturity, exact discount filters and sorting use real market data",
    "The borrowing quote enforces the actual collateral limit and review never signs",
    "A changed funded-pool quote is rejected before the original payout NFT moves",
    "A double press borrows once, keeps principal and maturity unchanged, and reload cannot reborrow",
    "Wallet changes clear borrowing offers, and repayment returns the same source payout NFT",
    "The sale alternative carries the quoted position directly into the listing form",
    "Review dialogs trap keyboard focus, restore focus on Escape and never auto-submit",
    "Seller lists an existing payout NFT without moving its principal or maturity",
    "Import rejects a payout right the connected wallet does not own",
    "A double press creates one purchase, delivers the original NFT and credits seller proceeds",
    "Seller withdraws the agreed 920 TUSD early-exit payment",
    "Buyer claims 1000 TUSD only after original maturity; reload neither reclaims nor replays",
    "The UI faucet and separate reference vault create a real listable test payout right",
    "A real cancellation between funding and buy leaves a recoverable balance; UI withdraws it",
    "A failed action keeps its own receipt; checking it never replays a transaction",
    "Marketplace token holdings exactly cover all remaining payment liabilities",
    "Eight app routes fit desktop, tablet, 390px and 320px; hero copy and comparison never overlap",
    "Mobile navigation closes on selection and reduced motion removes card movement",
    "Production build works under /timeshift/ and offers no fabricated or unconfigured trades"
  ],
